e-verify her charts and rebuild trust. Maris wants reassurance that Veya will not endanger The Hollow.","conflict":"Veya's refusal to admit she misjudged the bridge failure at Emberroost puts her at odds with Maris, who must choose between loyalty to home and her friendship with Veya.","outcome":"Veya admits her error, re-checks her charts, and finds the one stable route that is also the key to the Cartel's monopoly. Maris stays, though still wary.","summary":"At Silverspine, Veya's flaw strains her friendship with Maris until she admits she was wrong, and the corrected charts reveal what is really at stake.","depends_on":["scn_emberroost_sabotage"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Charter Hearing","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_docks_hearing","title":"The Charter Challenged","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to expose the failing network and the Cartel's hold on the last stable routes before the isles. Kael wants to defend the charter.","conflict":"Kael uses his ledger-mastery against the Wardens' case, while Veya must share her charts openly, giving up the hoarded control she had been protecting. Maris must show herself and her smuggling routes to prove the levy's harm.","outcome":"Veya shares her charts with every isle and Maris testifies, forcing the isles to choose, and a majority vote to void the charter's exclusive claim on the stable routes.","summary":"At the Mistral Docks hearing, Veya and Maris lay out the truth and force every isle to choose a side, while Kael fights to keep the charter intact.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_betrayal"]},{"id":"scn_docks_confrontation","title":"Price and Worth","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to seize the last stable routes by force after losing the vote. Veya wants to stop him without becoming a hoarder of the routes herself.","conflict":"Kael threatens to cut the routes rather than share them, and Veya must resist the temptation to take control herself while his ledger-mastery picks at her weaknesses.","outcome":"Veya's open charts make his seizure pointless, and Kael realises that control costs more than it gains. He stands down.","summary":"Kael and Veya face off at the docks. Her openness defeats his control, and he is forced to concede.","depends_on":["scn_docks_hearing"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"After the Charter","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_emberroost_rebuild","title":"Braiding Anew","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"The Wardens want to rebuild the failing bridges. Kael must pay for the damage his supply sabotage caused.","conflict":"Wardens distrust Kael and Kael struggles to give up his belief that price equals worth, while the wind-debt rule means every crossing still has to be repaid.","outcome":"Kael supplies cloudstone to the forge-island under Warden oversight as repayment, and the first reinforced bridges are braided from Veya's charts.","summary":"At Emberroost, Kael atones by supplying cloudstone and the Wardens begin repairing the network using Veya's shared charts.","depends_on":["scn_docks_confrontation"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_harvest","title":"The Quiet Harvest","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Maris wants The Hollow's grain to flow without the levy. Veya wants to thank her and keep their friendship.","conflict":"Maris still trusts slowly and must decide whether Veya is a friend or a risk now that the crisis is over.","outcome":"The levy is lifted, Maris accepts Veya as a friend, and she recognises that hiding was a form of bravery.","summary":"In The Hollow, the grain moves freely again and Maris and Veya reaffirm their friendship.","depends_on":["scn_emberroost_rebuild"]},{"id":"scn_silverspine_new_charts","title":"Charts for Every Isle","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants to record her mentor's theory and open the charts to all isles. Kael and Maris come to witness it.","conflict":"The isles are still drifting apart and the work is unfinished, so Veya must accept that recognition matters less than the shared work.","outcome":"The Academy publishes the open charts, crediting her mentor, and the three begin working on routes that stay safe for all.","summary":"At Silverspine, Veya publishes the open charts in her mentor's name, with former rivals watching, and the isles face the drift together.","depends_on":["scn_hollow_harvest"]}]}]}
