n whether Veya can be trusted.","conflict":"Every skybridge crossing accrues wind-debt that must be repaid within a season, and Veya is running short of goods. Maris trusts slowly and rarely forgives.","outcome":"They agree to trade wind-current knowledge for Maris's secret paths, and Veya pays the debt with a promise of labour.","summary":"Maris meets Veya at the busiest port and weighs her. They strike a bargain that makes them allies.","depends_on":["scn_hollow_levy_notice","scn_kael_offer"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_service_corridors","title":"Through the Service Corridors","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Maris wants to move grain unseen, and Veya wants to map the unmarked corridors that bypass failing bridges.","conflict":"Cartel enforcers are closing in on the smuggling routes, and Maris is reluctant to reveal her secrets to an outsider.","outcome":"They slip past the enforcers, and Veya adds a safe route to her charts while Maris begins to trust her.","summary":"Maris leads Veya through windmills and granaries and they evade the enforcers, which strengthens their friendship.","depends_on":["scn_wind_debt_bargain"]},{"id":"scn_wardens_sabotage_claim","title":"Sabotage at Emberroost","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants proof that the Cartel has cut supplies to the forge-island, and Kael wants to deny it and discredit her.","conflict":"Cloudstone supplies are missing and the Wardens blame the Cartel. Kael presents ledgers that make the shortage look like the Wardens' mismanagement.","outcome":"Veya is shaken when her evidence proves inconclusive, and the Wardens withdraw some of their support.","summary":"A confrontation at the forge-pits exposes the Toll War. Kael outmaneuvers Veya, and her refusal to concede a mistake costs her allies.","depends_on":["scn_kael_offer","scn_hollow_service_corridors"]},{"id":"scn_silverspine_charts_stolen","title":"The Charts Go Missing