he lives at stake.","outcome":"Kael sees that control costs more than it gains and stands aside. The Wardens, using the shared chart, redirect the crossing and the key bridge holds.","summary":"At the forge-island, the three characters meet at the failing bridge. The open chart defeats Kael's monopoly, and he yields.","depends_on":["scn_veya_shares_truth","scn_wardens_sabotage_claim"]}]},{"id":"act_four_new_currents","title":"New Currents","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_docks_levy_lifted","title":"The Levy Lifted","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Kael wants to settle the Cartel's position after the confrontation, and Maris wants the grain levy lifted for The Hollow.","conflict":"Cartel princes resist losing revenue, and Maris still distrusts Kael and will not forgive easily.","outcome":"Kael backs reduced tolls and an end to the levy, and Maris accepts the terms without forgiving him.","summary":"At the docks, Kael uses his ledger-mastery to renegotiate the Cartel's terms and ease the Toll War and the Grain Levy.","depends_on":["scn_bridge_collapse_confrontation"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_harvest_feast","title":"Harvest at The Hollow","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Maris wants to see The Hollow fed and secure, and Veya wants to thank the people whose paths made the chart possible.","conflict":"Maris must weigh her long-held caution against her friendship with Veya, and Veya struggles with her need for recognition.","outcome":"Maris learns that sheltering can be as brave as standing in the open, and Veya credits her fully.","summary":"The windmills turn and the isle celebrates, and the two women reaffirm their alliance.","depends_on":["scn_docks_levy_lifted"]},{"id":"scn_silverspine_new_atlas","title":"The Shared Atlas","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to establish an open atlas of the skybridge network that her late mentor's theory can inform.","conflict":"Kael's reconciliation with Veya is uneasy and the isles are still drifting, so the work will never be finished.","outcome":"The atlas is adopted by the Wardens, the Cartel and the Hollow Circle, and Veya, Kael and Maris each accept their new roles.","summary":"The three characters gather at the academy to open the atlas to all, and the story ends with the isles drifting but the people better prepared.","depends_on":["scn_hollow_harvest_feast"]}]}]}
